{"name":"HealthKit Metadata Keys 2026","version":"2026.1","publisher":"AIFitnessAPI (aifitnessapi.com)","license":"CC BY 4.0","methodology":"Every HKMetadataKey constant on Apple's Metadata Keys collection (https://developer.apple.com/documentation/healthkit/metadata-keys) and its Workout Metadata Keys sub-collection, read on 2026-10-04 from the JSON Apple serves to render developer.apple.com, one key page each. Names, topic group, abstract, platform versions and deprecation are copied from Apple's payload unchanged. One column is DERIVED: valueType, read from the sentence in Apple's own text that names what the key's value is; that sentence is published beside it in valueTypeEvidence, and both are null where Apple's text does not say. Apple's abstracts are reproduced for identification of the API surface.","generatedFrom":"src/data/healthkitMetadataKeys.ts (generated by scripts/fetch-healthkit-metadata-keys.mjs, then by scripts/build-datasets.mjs)","isBasedOn":"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/healthkit/metadata-keys","sourceReadOn":"2026-10-04","fields":{"swiftName":"The Swift constant name","objcName":"The Objective-C constant name; null where Apple gives none","group":"Apple's topic group on the Metadata Keys page","subgroup":"The section inside the Workout Metadata Keys sub-collection; null elsewhere","valueType":"DERIVED: the value type valueTypeEvidence names; null where Apple does not state it","valueTypeEvidence":"Apple's sentence valueType was read from, verbatim","iosIntroduced":"iOS version the key was introduced in, per Apple's availability data","watchosIntroduced":"watchOS version the key was introduced in, per Apple's availability data","deprecated":"yes when Apple's payload marks the key deprecated","abstract":"Apple's abstract, verbatim; null where Apple publishes none","appleDocs":"Apple's documentation page for the key","page":"This site's row for the key"},"items":[{"swiftName":"HKMetadataKeyExternalUUID","objcName":"HKMetadataKeyExtern